{"unit_id":"chunkithwang__craft-mermaid#card-zh","repo":"chunkithwang/craft-mermaid","commit":"6692cefb6c9a4234aee90e2fe0ee71348289228c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Craft Mermaid 是 DSH 的 Mermaid 图表 Skill 与工具插件。bundle 注册专用 Skill 文件系统、渲染和运行时初始化工具。插件规范化 .mmd 源码，使用固定 beautiful-mermaid 引擎和 Craft 明暗主题生成高清 PNG，并检查 SVG；Skill 指导 Agent 检视图片并最多修复两轮。支持流程图、状态图、时序图、类图、ER 图和 XY 图，适合制作可复现的设计与工作流图表。需要 Node.js 20+ 和已安装的渲染依赖，不需要 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:8-17","dsh-plugin/lib/index.js:81-89","dsh-plugin/lib/index.js:130-155","scripts/runtime/render.mjs:14-22","scripts/runtime/render.mjs:328-398","SKILL.md:32-70"]}
